# EmailJS Configuration for Brisbane Carpet Works
# All forms send emails to: Brisbanecarpetworks@gmail.com

# Get these values from https://www.emailjs.com/ after completing setup

# 1. Create account at emailjs.com
# 2. Add Gmail service and copy Service ID
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx

# 3. Create email template and copy Template ID  
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx

# 4. Get your Public Key from Account settings
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

# 5. (Optional) Customer confirmation template ID
VITE_EMAILJS_CUSTOMER_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx

# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to .env (in the same folder)
# 2. Replace the xxxxx values above with your actual EmailJS credentials
# 3. Save the .env file
# 4. Restart your development server
# 5. Test the forms - emails should arrive at Brisbanecarpetworks@gmail.com

# IMPORTANT: Never commit the .env file to git (it's already in .gitignore)
